{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfi7qmSWxNJAqUhZAAgqJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A8wE8FLjZXq9bDB462QUwN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/microtags.unidirectional-hydration-13-docs-and-adr-notes; sed -i '' 's#\\[ADR-007\\](./docs/adr/INDEX.md)#[ADR-007](./docs/adr/ADR-007-client-templater.md)#' README.md\ncat >> docs/adr/ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Note (2026-10-04)\n\n[ADR-007](./ADR-007-client-templater.md) changes the templater's return\ntype: `html`, `h`, and `raw` return opaque markup instead of a string,\nand callers that need HTML convert with `String(m)`. The render function\nmay return markup. A component that the browser creates (from `mount` or\na reactive region) must be kept, with `client: true` or the build-time\nkeep list; creating a stripped component throws. This ADR is not\nsuperseded.\nEOF\ncat >> docs/adr/ADR-006-hono-html-scaffold.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Note (2026-10-04)\n\n[ADR-008](./ADR-008-serialized-server-state.md) adds a second scaffold\nmarker, `<!--microtags:state-->`, placed before the module script, where\nthe server writes the serialized state as a JSON script. `assemble`\ntakes the page and the state payload and throws unless each marker\nappears exactly once. The page marker now sits inside a `<div\nid=\"root\">` wrapper, which the client mounts the layout into, and the\nnavigation moved from the scaffold into the layout. This ADR is not\nsuperseded.\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":62559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1007},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d134e0b9-0655-44e9-9843-19fd47b4c489","uuid":"f6752abd-c7d9-4d57-94c4-38442e570813","timestamp":"2026-10-05T00:09:34.168Z","request_id":"req_011Cfi7qjwivaHxXH4Yj2MT2","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01A8wE8FLjZXq9bDB462QUwN":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/microtags.unidirectional-hydration-13-docs-and-adr-notes; sed -i '' 's#\\[ADR-007\\](./docs/adr/INDEX.md)#[ADR-007](./docs/adr/ADR-007-client-templater.md)#' README.md\ncat >> docs/adr/ADR-005-single-file-components-with-build-time-render-stripping.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Note (2026-10-04)\n\n[ADR-007](./ADR-007-client-templater.md) changes the templater's return\ntype: `html`, `h`, and `raw` return opaque markup instead of a string,\nand callers that need HTML convert with `String(m)`. The render function\nmay return markup. A component that the browser creates (from `mount` or\na reactive region) must be kept, with `client: true` or the build-time\nkeep list; creating a stripped component throws. This ADR is not\nsuperseded.\nEOF\ncat >> docs/adr/ADR-006-hono-html-scaffold.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Note (2026-10-04)\n\n[ADR-008](./ADR-008-serialized-server-state.md) adds a second scaffold\nmarker, `<!--microtags:state-->`, placed before the module script, where\nthe server writes the serialized state as a JSON script. `assemble`\ntakes the page and the state payload and throws unless each marker\nappears exactly once. The page marker now sits inside a `<div\nid=\"root\">` wrapper, which the client mounts the layout into, and the\nnavigation moved from the scaffold into the layout. This ADR is not\nsuperseded.\nEOF"}}}
